{
  "title": "Tenant 360",
  "uid": "w34-tenant-360",
  "description": "=== W34 otel-sidecars (Coder C) === Per-tenant view: RED metrics for the selected allowlisted tenant (tenant_class label), trace link into Jaeger filtered by tenant.id, and an honest alert-history panel (live from the Alertmanager API; omitted when no Alertmanager datasource is configured — never static/fake data).",
  "tags": ["w34", "otel", "tenant"],
  "timezone": "utc",
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": { "from": "now-6h", "to": "now" },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "tenant",
        "label": "Tenant",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
        "query": "label_values(http_requests_total, tenant_class)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "includeAll": false,
        "multi": false,
        "sort": 1,
        "description": "Only allowlisted tenants appear as themselves; all others are the single 'other' class (cardinality guard, server/services/telemetryCardinality.ts)."
      }
    ]
  },
  "links": [
    {
      "title": "Traces in Jaeger (tenant.id = $tenant)",
      "type": "link",
      "url": "/d/jaeger?var-tenant=$tenant",
      "targetBlank": true,
      "asDropdown": false,
      "icon": "external link",
      "tags": []
    }
  ],
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Request rate (req/s)",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(http_requests_total{tenant_class=\"$tenant\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "requests/s"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "color": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "blue" }, "unit": "reqps" }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "area", "justifyMode": "auto", "orientation": "auto", "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false }, "textMode": "auto" }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Error ratio (5xx share)",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 8, "x": 8, "y": 0 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(http_requests_total{tenant_class=\"$tenant\",status_class=\"5xx\"}[5m])) / clamp_min(sum(rate(http_requests_total{tenant_class=\"$tenant\"}[5m])), 1e-9)",
          "legendFormat": "error ratio"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [ { "color": "green", "value": null }, { "color": "yellow", "value": 0.01 }, { "color": "red", "value": 0.05 } ] }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": { "colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "area", "justifyMode": "auto", "orientation": "auto", "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false }, "textMode": "auto" }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "p95 latency",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 0 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(http_request_duration_ms_bucket{tenant_class=\"$tenant\"}[5m])) by (le))",
          "legendFormat": "p95"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "unit": "ms",
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [ { "color": "green", "value": null }, { "color": "yellow", "value": 1000 }, { "color": "red", "value": 5000 } ] }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": { "colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "area", "justifyMode": "auto", "orientation": "auto", "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false }, "textMode": "auto" }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Requests by route (rate)",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 6 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (route) (rate(http_requests_total{tenant_class=\"$tenant\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{route}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" }, "unit": "reqps", "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 10, "lineWidth": 1, "showPoints": "never" } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" } }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "tRPC procedures (rate by procedure)",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 6 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (procedure) (rate(trpc_procedure_calls_total{tenant_class=\"$tenant\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{procedure}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" }, "unit": "reqps", "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 10, "lineWidth": 1, "showPoints": "never" } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" } }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Traces",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 14 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Distributed traces\n\nOpen [Jaeger](http://localhost:16686) and filter by span attribute `tenant.id=\"$tenant\"` (baggage `tenant.id` is set on every authenticated span by the platform tRPC middleware).\n\nPython sidecars (kyc-verifier, ai-agent) continue the same trace when the platform calls them with a `traceparent` header."
      },
      "transparent": true
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Alert history",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 14 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Alert history\n\nPer-tenant alerts (TenantErrorSpike) fire only for allowlisted tenants and are routed by Alertmanager. Alert history is queried live from the Alertmanager API (`/api/v2/alerts`, filter `tenant=\"$tenant\"`) — this panel is intentionally a pointer, not fabricated data: wire an Alertmanager datasource in Grafana to render it inline."
      },
      "transparent": true
    }
  ]
}
